  "details": "VRChat Version: Build 1258 (even before that)\nDescription of the bug:\nIn MM's World tab, when the list of worlds is scrolled slightly and the upper right UI (buttons for sort order, view settings, etc.) is overlapped with the world list, if the cursor is placed over the UI from the right, left, or top, the UI side is selected correctly, whereas if the cursor is placed over the UI from the bottom ( When the cursor is moved from the bottom of the UI (World list side), the selection of the World list side is maintained and the UI is not selected.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nAs above.\nAs far as I can see, it reproduces in PC Desktop and PC VR modes.\nI am not sure in other modes.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nAttached.\n(1. normal UI selected, 2. with the world list selected, 3.World list selection is maintained and UI is not selected)\nI translated it from Japanese to English using DeepL, so I apologize if it is difficult to read.",
